RUN.md:22:- T243 (first attempt, queue #108): Packet #14 @ ≈13–27 s — calendar-of-days panel with crossed-out dates. Mechanics (techniques-diagrams.md §T243): rounded panel holds grid of day numerals; most struck through with diagonal slashes, two ringed, dashed drop-lines connect two crossed dates to a timeline below whose labels are also struck out; second panel with empty checkboxes joins it. Draw-on order: grid → strikes → drop-lines → timeline labels — named order is the claim. Evidence: ev/020-calendar-days.jpg · ev/026-calendar-tasks-crossout.jpg. Consumer: DLC assembler diagram / transition containers. Variables: grid size/day numerals, struck/ringed sets, drop-line targets, timeline labels, draw-on timings, palette.
